& Logistic Regression & 0.617 & 0.640 & 0.617 & 0.611 \\ 
& Random Forest & 0.650 & 0.659 & 0.650 & 0.629\\ 
& SVM & 0.583 & 0.605 & 0.583 & 0.580\\ 
& KNN & 0.517 & 0.524 & 0.517 & 0.514\\
& CatBoost & 0.617 & 0.600 & 0.617 & 0.582\\
\hline
\multirow{4}{*}{BERT} 
& Logistic Regression & \textbf{0.783} & \textbf{0.809} & \textbf{0.783} & \textbf{0.779} \\ 
