\caption{\label{fig3} Comparison between the simulated charge collection and measured charge collection \cite{Kramberger_2015} for a proton irradiated LGAD with a fluence $4.9 \times 10^{14}$ 1 MeV $n_{eq}$ $cm^{-2}$. Simulation incorporating only PDM (left), simulation incorporating PDM and ARM (centre), and simulation incorporating PDM, ARM, and optimized Selb. parameter (right).}
