For function $h_2^+(z)$  the respective sum of residues reads
\begin{widetext}
\begin{equation}
\begin{split}
&\sum_{i=1}^2  \operatorname{res}\,(h_2^{+},z_i) =
\frac{m (G_0^2-\aH^2) (\alpha -\rmi \beta )^2\rme^{-\frac{\pi  b}{\alpha  \beta }+2
