    \caption{The HMF for the 20th (blue) and 80th (red) percentiles of each parameter value in the training Latin hypercube, while keeping all other parameters fixed. The lines show the expected average values based on the Tinker08 analytical HMF. The dots are the ground truth from a test simulation using $N$-body and \textsc{Rockstar}, with the model's mass bins. The stars represent the direct approach using the NN. Overall, the model is able to reproduce the analytical line and, more importantly, the ground truth quite well.}
