  \caption{[A-B] The new cable car connects a poor area of Cuidad Bolivar, Bogota, to the Bus Rapid Transit (BRT) system. [C] There are two planned lines, one of which opened in 2018 and the other which is planned to open in 2026. [D-E] These new lines connect to the BRT which is a radial system of buses with their own dedicated bus lane that runs throughout the wider city.}
