Let $\ep > 0$. Define $\ep_i = \frac{\ep}{i^2}$ and consider the particles/clusters $\cb{\mathfs{C}_{j_i}}_{i \in \mathds{Z}}$ for some fixed $\cb{j_i}_{i \in \mathds{Z}}$. We denote $\Delta j_i = j_{i+1}-j_i$ and choose $j_i$ s.t $\Delta j_i = \Delta j_{-i}$ to ensure symmetry.
