\documentclass[main]{subfiles}

\begin{document}

We provide an alternative proof of Lurie's result that the wide subcategory of the $\infty$-category of $\infty$-topoi spanned by the étale morphisms is closed under small colimits.
Our proof is based on a new characterization of étale morphisms of $\infty$-topoi in relation to univalent families and does not rely on a larger universe.
During the proof, we also give an elementary construction of univalent completion.

\end{document}

