\section{Impact Statements} \label{sec:impact}

\paragraph{Ethical considerations.}


The primary contribution is the efficient computation of $\nabla f(x)$ on modern Central Processing Units (CPUs). In its present form, the design is orthogonal to questions of bias, fairness, and privacy.

